   <text>
      <body>
         <div n="1" type="original">
         <pb facs="#facs_1" n="1"/>
         <milestone unit="section" facs="#facs_1_tr_1"/>
         <div n="2">
            <p>
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/683,489,3884,409" n="N001"/>This is the last Will and Testament of me John
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/221,855,4028,285" n="N002"/>Christian Bach of the Parish of Saint Mary la
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/274,974,4217,338" n="N003"/>bonne in the County of Middlesex Music-Master
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/280,1130,3958,424" n="N004"/>to her most gracious Majesty Queen Charlotte
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/420,1361,3851,296" n="N005"/>I Give devise and bequeath unto my Dear Wife
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/377,1490,4136,371" n="N006"/>Cecilia Bach late Cecilia Grassi All my Real and
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/366,1737,3969,275" n="N007"/>Personal Estate whatsoever and wheresoever
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/328,1936,4056,259" n="N008"/>To hold to her, her Heirs Executors Administrators
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/312,2087,4298,371" n="N009"/>and Assigns for ever but subject nevertheless to the
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/307,2351,4039,311" n="N010"/>Payment of my Debts and Funeral Expenses
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/355,2480,4206,387" n="N011"/>and of this my said Will I do appoint my said
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/307,2684,4233,312" n="N012"/>Dear Wife Cecilia Sole Executrix In Witness
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/296,2813,4319,371" n="N013"/>whereof I the said John Christian Bach the Testator
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/269,3077,4330,199" n="N014"/>have hereunto set my hand and Seal this Fourteenth
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/274,3249,1931,322" n="N015"/>Day of November 1781
            </p>
         </div>
         <div n="2" rend="container">
            <milestone unit="section" facs="#facs_1_r"/>
            <div n="3" rend="textblock">
            <p>
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/145,3394,2195,285" n="N001"/>Signed Sealed Published and
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/102,3604,2340,269" n="N002"/>Declared by the said John Chris<span type="hyphen">-</span>
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/151,3754,2151,275" n="N003"/>tian Bach as &amp; for his last
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/124,3905,2189,221" n="N004"/>Will and Testament in the
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/124,4045,2092,204" n="N005"/>Presence of Us who in his
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/167,4195,2205,242" n="N006"/>Presence &amp; at his request and in
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/156,4351,2259,189" n="N007"/>the Presence of each other have
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/172,4464,2098,194" n="N008"/>subscribed our Names as
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/151,4593,1613,264" n="N009"/>Witnesses thereto
            </p>
            </div>
            <milestone unit="section" facs="#facs_1_r_80"/>
            <div n="3" rend="tb cbr-li">
            <p>
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/2738,3615,1016,322" n="N001"/>JCBach</p>
            </div>
            </div>
         <milestone unit="section" facs="#facs_1_r_81"/>
         <div n="2">
            <p>
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/199,4755,1329,360" n="N001"/>Mary Zoffany
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/199,5029,1210,285" n="N002"/>Francis Mecci
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00001.tif/285,5228,1490,339" n="N003"/>Augus Greenland
            </p>
         </div>
         <pb facs="#facs_2" n="2"/>
         <milestone unit="section" facs="#facs_2_tr_1"/>
         <div n="2">
            <p>
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/1525,0,1547,378" n="N001"/>20<hi style="vertical-align: superscript;">th</hi> February 1782.
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/192,263,4399,357" n="N002"/>Cecilia Bach Widow the Relict of the Testator
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/154,477,4360,455" n="N003"/>and sole Executrix within named was duly sworn
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/148,746,839,247" n="N004"/>as usual.
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/1975,713,1173,433" n="N005"/>Before Me
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/472,1152,746,587" n="N006"/>Bishop
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/2112,1102,1481,467" n="N007"/>And. Colbee Ducarel
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/2605,1459,686,373" n="N008"/>Surrogate
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/121,1986,3016,444" n="N009"/>Testator died 1.<hi style="vertical-align: superscript;">st</hi> January 1782
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/735,2463,3735,499" n="N010"/>Proved at London the 20<hi style="vertical-align: superscript;">th</hi> day of February 1782
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/719,2803,3642,356" n="N011"/>before the Worshipful Andrew Colbee Ducarel
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/686,3055,3834,269" n="N012"/>Doctor of Laws and Surrogate by the Oath of Cecilia
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/642,3187,3998,252" n="N013"/>Bach Widow the Relict and Sole Extrix. to whom
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/675,3362,3861,395" n="N014"/>Adinon. was Granted having been first Sworn
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00002.tif/675,3593,1014,279" n="N015"/>duly to Adm.<hi style="vertical-align: superscript;">n</hi>
            </p>
         </div>
         <pb facs="#facs_3" n="3"/>
         <pb facs="#facs_4" n="4"/>
         <milestone unit="section" facs="#facs_4_tr_2"/>
         <div n="2">
            <p>
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00004.tif/1657,156,325,280" n="N001"/>Will
               <lb facs="iiif:fpb%2FGB-Lna%2Frvvvm%2Fgb_lna_prob10_prerogative_court_of_canterbury_and_other_probate_jurisdictions_2862_00004.tif/3174,174,400,218" n="N002"/>Midde
